---
manual: edit_box.change_on_type_and_delete
lines: [3017, 3019]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @box = edit_box { $seen << @box.text }
end
----------- test code
click_on edit_box
type_text "abc"
assert_equal "abc", edit_box.text
$seen.clear

press_key :backspace
assert_equal ["ab"], $seen, "deleting a character runs the block too"

press_key :backspace
assert_equal %w[ab a], $seen, "once per deleted character"
